    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>]</mo></math> denote the greatest integer less than or equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br />Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>{</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>}</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>]</mo><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi></math> is :",
